    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant medieval village, a determined cow begins an unexpected adventure \u2014 racing across dangerous farm platforms to reunite with her lost calf, hidden deep inside an old barn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the path won\u2019t be easy. Tricky farmers have set traps, enemies lurk behind haystacks, and deadly obstacles like spinning saws and falling crates stand in your way. This is no ordinary farm\u2026 and this is no ordinary cow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission in this game is to</strong> help the cow navigate through each challenging level by moving crates, avoiding traps, and outsmarting enemies \u2014 all while racing against danger to reach her calf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Racing</strong> blends fast-paced platforming with puzzle-solving. Some blocks can be pushed, others can\u2019t. One wrong move can send the cow tumbling off a platform or straight into a spinning blade. You\u2019ll need sharp thinking and precise timing to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide her safely through all the farm\u2019s dangers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish platforming gameplay with puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted levels full of farmyard hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 2D visuals with a medieval farm atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant medieval village, a determined cow begins an unexpected adventure \u2014 racing across dangerous farm platforms to reunite with her lost calf, hidden deep inside an old barn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the path won\u2019t be easy. Tricky farmers have set traps, enemies lurk behind haystacks, and deadly obstacles like spinning saws and falling crates stand in your way. This is no ordinary farm\u2026 and this is no ordinary cow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission in this game is to</strong> help the cow navigate through each challenging level by moving crates, avoiding traps, and outsmarting enemies \u2014 all while racing against danger to reach her calf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Racing</strong> blends fast-paced platforming with puzzle-solving. Some blocks can be pushed, others can\u2019t. One wrong move can send the cow tumbling off a platform or straight into a spinning blade. You\u2019ll need sharp thinking and precise timing to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide her safely through all the farm\u2019s dangers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish platforming gameplay with puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted levels full of farmyard hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 2D visuals with a medieval farm atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
